(6092582, 896921, 84323, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite shot in the challenge. I love the vintage mood, and the sun streaks.  Nice job.</td>', 'This was my favorite shot in the challenge. I love the vintage mood, and the sun streaks.  Nice job.', '2010-07-14 12:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6092626, 897529, 39679, '<td valign="top">Because almost every challenge has one of these "drop into liquid" shots (and I''m getting tired of seeing them),I normally score them poorly but in this case, you''ve done a great job of taking the interest off of the splash and onto the colors and patterns in the water.  I really enjoy this shot.</td>', 'Because almost every challenge has one of these "drop into liquid" shots (and I''m getting tired of seeing them),I normally score them poorly but in this case, you''ve done a great job of taking the interest off of the splash and onto the colors and patterns in the water.  I really enjoy this shot.', '2010-07-14 12:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
