(6092860, 896947, 117474, '<td valign="top">DNMC!<br/>Just kiddin''! Lots of spheres here. Nice deep colours in the blue. I''m not a big fan of the green ones, but I like how they look through the big one in the centre. <br/>Actually. It''s not very central, is it? It''s a little leftish. Was that intentional?</td>', 'DNMC!Just kiddin''! Lots of spheres here. Nice deep colours in the blue. I''m not a big fan of the green ones, but I like how they look through the big one in the centre. Actually. It''s not very central, is it? It''s a little leftish. Was that intentional?', '2010-07-14 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6092874, 896825, 117474, '<td valign="top">Love the tones, colours, age, and feel. <br/>One thing I can''t quite make out (and I think I''ll be giving you the benefit of my doubt) is whether the glar-like looking thing on the top right is from flash/lighting. I don''t think it is cause it''s there at the bottom too. If it isn''t due to the lighting I think it''d look better with a consistent one. I like that none of the balls are nice and flat.</td>', 'Love the tones, colours, age, and feel. One thing I can''t quite make out (and I think I''ll be giving you the benefit of my doubt) is whether the glar-like looking thing on the top right is from flash/lighting. I don''t think it is cause it''s there at the bottom too. If it isn''t due to the lighting I think it''d look better with a consistent one. I like that none of the balls are nice and flat.', '2010-07-14 16:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
