(6094700, 897490, 109541, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Very simple, almost monochromatic.  I would crop this with a little less of the left edge and put this sphere at the thirds intersection (likely too much composition studies !!).  I think this is "Bubble on Young Ladies Back".  I like the sharpness of the bubble, I like the subtle colors at the top of the bubble.  I really like this!</td>', 'I really like this.  Very simple, almost monochromatic.  I would crop this with a little less of the left edge and put this sphere at the thirds intersection (likely too much composition studies !!).  I think this is "Bubble on Young Ladies Back".  I like the sharpness of the bubble, I like the subtle colors at the top of the bubble.  I really like this!', '2010-07-16 01:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
