(6094720, 897351, 94241, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea.  The specular highlights kind of break the mood for me though, and the stands under the globes are underexposed.  Both of these I think stem from the same source: lighting highly reflective objects directly.  If you had instead lit the room they were in, and only indirectly lit the objects, I think it would have come out as a stronger image.</td>', 'Brilliant idea.  The specular highlights kind of break the mood for me though, and the stands under the globes are underexposed.  Both of these I think stem from the same source: lighting highly reflective objects directly.  If you had instead lit the room they were in, and only indirectly lit the objects, I think it would have come out as a stronger image.', '2010-07-16 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
