(6094938, 896862, 112739, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have two light sources from the right. Can''t seem to take my eyes away from the debris on the mirror on the lower right. Some other reflections coming in too are a little distracting. Hard to place the eye on any one item. Good idea.</td>', 'Looks like you have two light sources from the right. Can''t seem to take my eyes away from the debris on the mirror on the lower right. Some other reflections coming in too are a little distracting. Hard to place the eye on any one item. Good idea.', '2010-07-16 13:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
