(6094963, 897626, 112739, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2010-07-16 13:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094982, 897480, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tomarto? Fortunately, I don''t deduct pointage for spelling.</td>', 'Tomarto? Fortunately, I don''t deduct pointage for spelling.', '2010-07-16 14:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094984, 897533, 83313, '<td valign="top">Where''s the anima? Maybe that spot in the water is a bird? At any rate, not bad at all for something that appears to be shot under midday sun. Some serious tilt that would have been very easy to correct, however.</td>', 'Where''s the anima? Maybe that spot in the water is a bird? At any rate, not bad at all for something that appears to be shot under midday sun. Some serious tilt that would have been very easy to correct, however.', '2010-07-16 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094988, 897653, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool globey thing, I have one just like it. Oh, and please make sure to pick up the dry cleaning on your way home.</td>', 'Cool globey thing, I have one just like it. Oh, and please make sure to pick up the dry cleaning on your way home.', '2010-07-16 14:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094990, 897539, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good job at keeping yourself out of the reflection. I''d guess you are hiding behind the eye.</td>', 'Good job at keeping yourself out of the reflection. I''d guess you are hiding behind the eye.', '2010-07-16 14:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094992, 897316, 83313, '<td valign="top">Extra pointage for the weirdness of this.</td>', 'Extra pointage for the weirdness of this.', '2010-07-16 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094997, 897521, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, but to be honest, it comes off to me as a rather flat and uninteresting view. The cluttered background is a major problem and does not add any context to the scene. I wonder if there may have been some other perspective you could have shot this from? Perhaps close to one of the outlying balls, from a low perspective, so that the sky is the background. Don''t know if that was doable or not, however.</td>', 'An interesting subject, but to be honest, it comes off to me as a rather flat and uninteresting view. The cluttered background is a major problem and does not add any context to the scene. I wonder if there may have been some other perspective you could have shot this from? Perhaps close to one of the outlying balls, from a low perspective, so that the sky is the background. Don''t know if that was doable or not, however.', '2010-07-16 14:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6094998, 897402, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bale of hay is a cylinder shape, not a sphere, I''m afraid. I suppose it could pass for spherical if I didn''t know it wasn''t.</td>', 'A bale of hay is a cylinder shape, not a sphere, I''m afraid. I suppose it could pass for spherical if I didn''t know it wasn''t.', '2010-07-16 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1);
