(6098272, 896659, 49954, '<td valign="top">I love that one actually and wanted to give it a 6 or 7... but something about the processing and the imperfections on the balls/marbles/bearings made it a 5 from me.  Especially the front most one has a couple of big scratches that really distracted.<br/> <br/>Great idea though and I wouldn''t hesitate to reshoot for another challenge.<br/> <br/>Basic editing sucks too :)</td>', 'I love that one actually and wanted to give it a 6 or 7... but something about the processing and the imperfections on the balls/marbles/bearings made it a 5 from me.  Especially the front most one has a couple of big scratches that really distracted. Great idea though and I wouldn''t hesitate to reshoot for another challenge. Basic editing sucks too :)', '2010-07-20 15:35:20.000000', NULL, 1);
