(6100875, 897491, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by klkitchens:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by klkitchens:</b></div><hr/><i> My top pick for this challenge. Perhaps even better than mine! (kidding)  Nicely done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was right :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>HA - I called it before you did! lol</td>', 'Originally posted by klkitchens: Originally posted by klkitchens: My top pick for this challenge. Perhaps even better than mine! (kidding)  Nicely done.   I was right :)   HA - I called it before you did! lol', '2010-07-22 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
