(6100901, 897621, 117474, '<td valign="top">Heh. You suck at DPC bingo! :) <br/>I gave you a 5 cause I thought I might comment that it was out of focus, that you should use a smaller aperture and that some of the leaves were distracting, in particular the one on the left. <br/>But realistically I thought it was interestingly done, processed and I really liked the small drops of water on the bulb. I should have sixed it to be fair.</td>', 'Heh. You suck at DPC bingo! :) I gave you a 5 cause I thought I might comment that it was out of focus, that you should use a smaller aperture and that some of the leaves were distracting, in particular the one on the left. But realistically I thought it was interestingly done, processed and I really liked the small drops of water on the bulb. I should have sixed it to be fair.', '2010-07-22 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6100937, 897583, 112739, '<td valign="top">See what happens? Forget about how your "basic editing" workflow should go and you get a DQ. I get to take a week off now! WooHoo! Can finally sleep on Tuesday nights now. <br/> <br/>Glad you all liked the image, thanks for your votes and great comments.</td>', 'See what happens? Forget about how your "basic editing" workflow should go and you get a DQ. I get to take a week off now! WooHoo! Can finally sleep on Tuesday nights now.  Glad you all liked the image, thanks for your votes and great comments.', '2010-07-22 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
